	(text "INH : INH is an open drain (high polarity) output pin \nwhich indicates whether the device is in sleep mode.\nWhen the device is in sleep mode, the driver is turned off (Hi-Z). \nA pull down resistance external to the PHY can\nbe used (10 kΩ recommended) \nwhich pulls down the INH pin down to 0 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 118.364 109.474 0)
		(effects
